{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The Elohim of the Hebrews.</b> Since you said, 'Who is this?' — behold, He is the Elohim of the Hebrews, renowned, who uphold the doctrines of Eber. And as for your saying that even this you will not permit — behold, how good it would be for you to heed His voice, <b>lest He strike</b> us and you alike."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:27.208322726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}